### **6. No HTTPS Enforcement (OWASP A02:2021 — Cryptographic Failures)**
The app listens on HTTP only. This exposes all data in transit to sniffing or tampering.

#### ❌ Issue:
- No TLS → data sent in cleartext.
- No redirect from HTTP → HTTPS.

