##### **7. No Logging (A09)**
**Risk**: Without logs, **intrusions or errors** go unnoticed.

**Recommendation**: Use [`morgan`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/morgan) for HTTP logging and [`winston`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/winston) for application logging.

**Code Fix**:
