##### **8. No CORS Policy (A05)**
**Risk**: If the API is accessed from browsers, **Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS)** misconfigurations can lead to **security issues**.

**Recommendation**: Explicitly configure CORS with [`cors`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/cors).

**Code Fix**:
```javascript
const cors = require('cors');
app.use(cors({
  origin: 'https://your-trusted-domain.com', // Restrict to trusted origins
}));
```

