##### **9. No HTTPS (A02)**
**Risk**: Data is transmitted in **plaintext**, making it vulnerable to **man-in-the-middle (MITM)** attacks.

**Recommendation**:
- Use `HTTPS` in production.
- Enforce HTTPS with [`express-enforces-ssl`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/express-enforces-ssl).

